#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-c-rtk-9p-gps.rst:5
#: f1edc77840094b3e98b77f4f81141fe3
msgid "CUAV C-RTK 9P GPS"
msgstr "CUAV C-RTK 9P GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-c-rtk-9p-gps.rst:7
#: d1c1e7a10ed94cc7bfa9ffb7ce44a25d
msgid ""
"This article mainly introduces C-RTK 9P based on Ublox F9P. The C-RTK 9P "
"offers more accurate positional accuracy and shorter convergence times than "
"the Ublox M8P module. This description uses the Mission Planner for setup, "
"but you can also use QgroundControl."
msgstr ""
"本文主要介绍基于 Ublox F9P 的 C-RTK 9P。C-RTK 9P 比 Ublox M8P 模块提供更高的定位精度和更短的收敛时间。本说明使用"
" Mission Planner 进行设置，但您也可以使用 QGroundControl。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cuav-c-rtk-9p-gps.rst:14
#: 6ca52baa9eb5483cab1ff5a4d5d7094c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently configure UBlox F9P GPS constellations. User "
"must assure that the GPS is properly configured for his region and "
"application. See :ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前不配置 UBlox F9P GPS 星座。用户必须确保 GPS 针对其地区和应用进行了正确配置。请参阅 "
":ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`"

